    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensColimitApex is MittensColimitApex: the colimit apex — the assembled individual Mittens; the object whose representable functor Hom(-,MittensColimitApex) is the Yoneda subject. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'A', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

