silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_06_yoneda_for_mittens_yoneda_hom_leg
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "YonedaForMittensYonedaHomLegExample" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'YonedaForMittensYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Yoneda for Mittens', the representable profile Y_in(Mittens) = Hom(-,MittensColimitApex) is the complete in-profile; the Yoneda embedding is fully faithful, so this profile uniquely characterizes MittensColimitApex up to isomorphism.; also, In 'Yoneda for Mittens', the out-profile Y_out(Mittens) = Hom(MittensColimitApex, -) reads the arrows from MittensColimitApex to competing cocones (VetCarePlan_77, GroomingLog_42); not monic because multiple competing cocones may receive arrows from MittensColimitApex." .

