    silm:hasExample "In 'DistributiveLawConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, SHACLValidationMonad: the SHACL validation monad T_Pi; operations Pi = {check_shape, report_pass, report_fail}; applies TartuClinicSHACLShapes to a record; produces SHACLPassReport_77 on success; the validation gate of the publish pipeline; also, DistLaw_PublishValidation: the distributive law lambda: T_Sigma(T_Pi(VetRecord_77)) -> T_Pi(T_Sigma(VetRecord_77)); commutes the SHACL validation (T_Pi) and publish tree (T_Sigma) monads; ensures that validate-then-publish equals publish-then-validate at the monad level; also, EncyclopediaPublicationMonad: the composed monad T_Pi circ T_Sigma; the full encyclopedia publication monad; its carrier type is validated-published records; an element of T_Pi(T_Sigma(VetRecord_77)) is a validation-wrapped publish tree, e.g., SHACLPass(VetRecord_77_tree)." .

