    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "DistributiveLawYonedaHomLegExample" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'DistributiveLawYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Distributive Law', the validate-then-publish path: T_Sigma(T_Pi(VetRecord_77)) -> T_Pi(T_Sigma(VetRecord_77)); the SHACL validation gate (T_Pi) is applied first producing SHACLPassReport_77, then the publish tree (T_Sigma) wraps the validated record; lambda witnesses that this equals the publish-then-validate order.; also, In 'Distributive Law', the publish-then-validate path: T_Pi(T_Sigma(VetRecord_77)); the publish tree (T_Sigma) wraps VetRecord_77 first into VetRecord_77_tree, then the SHACL validation monad (T_Pi) gates the tree; produces SHACLPass(VetRecord_77_tree) as an element of EncyclopediaPublicationMonad." .

